# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# AUD — Music Service Configuration
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# AUD speaks to a remote music service over HTTP. Two backends are
# supported out of the box; how it picks one is controlled by
# VITE_CATALOG_MODE.
#
#   cp .env.example .env   →   edit values   →   npm run build
#
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# VITE_CATALOG_MODE — auto | beatbox | rest | demo
#
#   auto     (default when a URL is set)  Try BeatBox/JioSaavn first
#            (10 parallel seed queries, 15-min session cache), then
#            the legacy REST contract below, else the bundled demo
#            catalog via the on-screen fallback.
#   beatbox  Only the BeatBox worker. Hard error on failure.
#   rest     Only the legacy REST contract. Hard error on failure.
#   demo     Ignore the URL entirely — always the bundled catalog.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# BeatBox worker (JioSaavn-compatible), used by the live preview:
#   VITE_MUSIC_API_URL=https://aud29.thangamprabhu1.workers.dev
#
#   GET {url}/api/search/songs?query=<text>
#        → { data: { results: [ { id, name, year, duration, language,
#             image[], primaryArtists, album, downloadUrl[]{quality,url},
#             url } ] } }
#   Images + audio stream from saavncdn.com (no CORS needed). The worker
#   itself must allow cross-origin GETs from your origin, or the browser
#   will block it — in that case AUD shows a clear error screen with a
#   "Continue with demo catalog" escape hatch. Add
#   Access-Control-Allow-Origin: * to the worker's GET responses to fix.
#
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Legacy REST contract (your own backend), used as fallback in `auto`:
#   GET {url}/songs      -> Song[]
#   GET {url}/artists    -> Artist[]
#   GET {url}/albums     -> Album[]
#   GET {url}/playlists  -> Playlist[]
# See README.md → "Connecting your music service" for field contracts.

VITE_MUSIC_API_URL=https://aud29.thangamprabhu1.workers.dev
VITE_CATALOG_MODE=auto
